    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "USAIR\nSystem Timetable\nEffective November 1, 1983\nNew Nonstop Service\nRichmond, Va.-\nPittsburgh\nPhiladelphia\nWashington, D.C.\n(Dulles International)\nWashington, D.C.-\n(Dulles International)\nPittsburgh\nRichmond, Va.\nIncludes Allegheny Commuter Service",
      "1:00 P.M.\nPACIFIC TIME\n2:00 P.M.\nMOUNTAIN TIME\n3:00 P.M\nCENTRAL TIME\nUSAIR\nService to over 90 cities\nin the U.S. and Canada.\nMININE APOLIST. PAUL\n4:00 P.M.\nEASTERN TIME\nNIAGARA-\nMONTREAM\nURLINGTON\nTINSON CT\nBETHLEHEM/ EASTO\nGTON. DC\nDENIVER\nSAN FRANCISCO\nKANSAS CITYS\nGRAND RAPIDS O\nCHICAGO (\nEVANSVILLE\nLOS ANGELES\nDETROI\nTOLEDO\nANOXVILLE\nNASHALLE\nBIRMINGHAM •\nRALEIGH/DURHAI\n• TUCSON\nDALLAS/FT. WORTHO\nHOUSTON\nSAN ANTONIO 6\nFORT LAUOLROALI\nUSAir \u0026\nAllegheny Commuter-\nA great team to go with.\nService to over 120 cities\nin the U.S. and Canada.\nUSAIe\nNAGARAEANO\nWILLIAMSP\nFLINT C\nBRADPORDIV\nMANSFIELİ\nCOLUMBUS\nE PARKERSBURG/MARIETTA\nLEXINGTON\nOLONDONICORHIN\n• NASHVILLE\nALLEGHENY\nCOMMUTER\nNEW YORK/NEWARI\nRENT ETALEREMIEASTON\n• CAPE MAY/WLOWOOD\nWASHINGTON"
